WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.296
Welcome to the Community Welcome Screen — built for events and workshops.

2
00:00:04.296 --> 00:00:11.088
Watch the wordmark animate in, the heading reveal word by word, and particles drift across the background.

3
00:00:11.088 --> 00:00:15.888
Turn on bot avatars and playful clay characters float behind the welcome stage.

4
00:00:15.888 --> 00:00:21.936
Open the editor to customize your brand, title, date, sponsors, and replay interval.

5
00:00:21.936 --> 00:00:27.120
The Grok Bot screen adds colorful blob characters that bounce and float around the stage.

6
00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:30.672
Hit Share to copy a link with your full configuration baked in.
